<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55066" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάρρῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>irrigated, watered</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					777
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάπη Χιόνι κατάρυτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1067
				</span></i>
			(lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Andr.</u>
				215
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ ἔνδροσός τε καὶ κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				10.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνη κ. αἵματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ma.</u>
					12.16
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρος κ</span>. <i>channelled by
				streams</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				199.12
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Adule</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>flowing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Olymp.
					<u>in Mete.</u>
					128.32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>carried down by water, alluvial</i>, of the Delta, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>with a steep slope</i>, of a <i>testudo</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				28.11.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
